      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"incident-01-1\", \"workflow\": \"incident\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-incident-01-1\", \"service_id\": \"S-incident-01-1\", \"goals\": [\"incident\", \"note\"], \"structure\": \"linked\", \"instructions\": \"Read the requested service's response_ticket_id, then that ticket's service_id. Read that linked service and its policy. Record an incident on the linked service and append its diagnosis note to the response ticket, not to the requested ticket.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
